<div id="about" class="container width-100 justify-end">
    <div class="col padd-y-8 gap-8">
        <div class="col gap-4">
            <div class="col">
                <h2>Let's get to the nitty gritty.</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row gap-10" data-stack="768">
        <div class="col gap-4">
            <img class="img foto" src="/assets/images/about/rojo@2x.png"
                srcset="<%= imgSrcset('/assets/images/about/rojo@2x.png') %>" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 90vw, 400px"
                alt="Portrait of David Rojo" width="812" height="812" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </div>
        <div class="col gap-6">
            <div class="row">
                <%- include('../../components/about-switch'); %>
            </div>
            <p class="about-content marg-0">
                <strong>My name is David Rojo(rroh-hoh). I'm a multidisciplinary designer, illustrator, and
                    developer</strong>
                with the heart of an artist, the logic of an engineer, and the speed of a mongoose. I am a sucker
                for good branding, micro-interactions, and understanding how everything works under the hood.
                <br><br>
                I have spent most of my career working with start-ups and small independent companies. I excel at
                building zero-to-one products by understanding business objectives, operations, and discovering user
                pain points. As
                a founding designer, I get my hands dirty, doing whatever it takes to position products and companies
                for growth through research, testing, experimentation, differentiation, and operational improvements.
                <br><br>
                Currently, I lead all product and design initiatives at a med-tech startup that is changing the standard
                of care in dental radiology. I also moonlight in the adult beverage industry,
                leveraging illustration to create distinctive brands, packaging, and merchandise.
            </p>
            <ul class="col gap-4 about-content display-none">
                <li>From ideation to production, I own the whole road.</li>
                <li><b>Product Leadership:</b> I research, discover, and plan what's actually worth building ensuring
                    time isn't wasted on endeavors that don't improve the user experience or business outcomes.</li>
                <li><b>Design Systems:</b> Establishing a system ensures
                    your
                    experience remains consistent and eliminates drift. I create rules and build libraries
                    that work on any framework.
                </li>
                <li><b>Product Design:</b> From rapid functional prototypes to MVP. I design, test,
                    and build
                    polished interfaces that remove user friction, feel great to use, and positively impact revenue.
                </li>
                <li><b>Front-End Engineering:</b> I learned to code before AI became mainstream. While I learned the
                    full stack, I specialize in front-end development, ensuring the minute details are not
                    overlooked.
                <li><b>Identity & Branding:</b> I love helping young companies grow! I create identities and
                    consistent visual languages that help you carve out your reputation and space in the market.
                </li>
                <li><b>Vector Illustration: </b>Style agnostic and scalable. I bring ideas to life that translate
                    perfectly for merchandising.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="about-content marg-0 display-none">
                Sample Text

            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>